# Carried dependency patches are unified diffs: every context line is the original file's
# tab-indented code behind a single leading space, and blank context lines carry one space --
# both are what `git apply` requires byte-for-byte, so "fixing" them would break the patch.
# Exempt them the same way as the generated header above, so `git diff --check` keeps reporting
# real problems in hand-written sources.
cmake/patches/*.patch -whitespace
